      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-15T00:31:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it does not help readability that much, especially now you need to read that extra comment and BUILD_CHECK_INLINE as well. Also if we change compiler options or compiler itself we will need to change this back. So I think it\u0027s not quite worth it to change to strlen()",
